=== A Call to Soul-Winning
--- A Call to Soul-Winning [title]
overline: Romans 10:14–17
heading: A Call to Soul-Winning
sub: The Chain from Sending to Salvation

--- The verses
scripture: Romans 10:14-15
big: Romans 10:17

--- The chain
step: 1 | God SENDS His people
step: 2 | Soul-winners PREACH the gospel of peace
step: 3 | The lost HEAR the word of Christ
step: 4 | FAITH COMETH by hearing
step: 5 | They BELIEVE on the Lord Jesus Christ
step: 6 | They CALL upon His name and are SAVED

--- Backward and forward
p: Paul asks the questions backward (from calling all the way back to sending) to show every step is essential.
p: But the process itself flows forward: God sends → we preach → they hear → faith comes → they believe → they call → they are saved.

--- Old Testament roots
kicker: A Call to Soul-Winning
scripture: Nahum 1:15
scripture: Isaiah 52:7
